    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice to the public under Sub section (1) ofthe Section 07 of the Acquisition Act, as amended by theLand Acquisition Act, (Amendment) No. 28 of 1964, theLand/ servitude described below is required by thegovernment and the government intends to acquire the saidland for public purpose.",
