    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.12,
      625.2,
      307.63,
      690.95
    ],
    "text": "01. Block No. 1068Name of the land: Angurupeassagoda Pathana orHingurugamuwa Division of GlenAlphin Estate; Discription:Garden, There are 06 Acacia tree of 15-20 years old, a Bo treeof 10 -15 years old, 03 Erabadu trees of 10 - 15 years old, ashrine and part of a permanent building; Claimant: Land",
