    "bbox": [
      321.12,
      314.16,
      561.29,
      357.59
    ],
    "text": "Reforms Commission; Original Title Holder: Part of the blockof 546, Surveyed to provide under long term leasing to theBrilliant Garments (PVT) Limited Company located at No. 142/9, 1/1, Galle Road, Colombo 03; Extent: 1.1829 Hectares.",
