      485.52,
      561.01,
      531.59
    ],
    "text": "All those who claim ownership, interested and any otherconnection to aforesaid land, should appear personally, orby agents duly authorized in writing before me at DivisionalSecretariat, Badulla on 03.09.2018 at 10.30 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
